{"timestamp":"00:09:31.670","source":"Browser","level":"LOG","message":"{\"game\":{\"appImage\":\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/250820/header.jpg?t=1574723957\",\"appid\":\"250820\",\"title\":\"SteamVR\"},\"news\":[{\"author\":\"evanf\",\"contents\":\"Today's SteamVR release improves streaming robustness, brings the Steam Frame \\\"Aurora\\\" environment to the desktop, and improves gamepad support in VR titles for Frame users. If you encounter issues with this update, please post in the SteamVR Bug Report forum. If possible, please include a SteamVR System Report to aid in tracking down your issue. The Steam Link for Meta Quest FAQ page is available here.Replies to this post are not tracked for bug reporting purposes. Please use the forum linked a...\",\"date\":1792606565,\"title\":\"Introducing SteamVR 2.18\"},{\"author\":\"evanf\",\"contents\":\"If you encounter issues with this update, please post in the SteamVR Bug Report forum. If possible, please include a system report to aid in tracking down your issue. Replies to this post are not tracked for bug reporting purposes. Please use the forum linked above to report issues.The Steam Link for Meta Quest FAQ page is available here.Anyone can opt into the SteamVR Beta. Instructions are available here.SteamVR:Fix crashes at startup with certain games.Fix occasional crash when unblocking pre...\",\"date\":1792189978,\"title\":\"SteamVR Beta Updated - 2.18.4\"},{\"author\":\"JustJeff\",\"contents\":\"If you encounter issues with this update, please post in the SteamVR Bug Report forum. If possible, please include a system report to aid in tracking down your issue. Replies to this post are not tracked for bug reporting purposes. Please use the forum linked above to report issues. The Steam Link for Meta Quest FAQ page is available here. Anyone can opt into the SteamVR Beta. Instructions are available here. Steam Frame:By default, Steam Frame controllers will now use gamepad input in VR games ...\",\"date\":1791593447,\"title\":\"SteamVR Beta Updated - 2.18.3\"},{\"author\":\"jeremys\",\"contents\":\"If you encounter issues with this update, please post in the SteamVR Bug Report forum. If possible, please include a system report to aid in tracking down your issue. Replies to this post are not tracked for bug reporting purposes. Please use the forum linked above to report issues. The Steam Link for Meta Quest FAQ page is available here. Anyone can opt into the SteamVR Beta. Instructions are available here. Streaming:Further VR streaming reliability improvements, including additional fixes for...\",\"date\":1790878941,\"title\":\"SteamVR Beta Updated - 2.18.2\"},{\"author\":\"J Bot\",\"contents\":\"If you encounter issues with this update, please post in the SteamVR Bug Report forum. If possible, please include a system report to aid in tracking down your issue. Replies to this post are not tracked for bug reporting purposes. Please use the forum linked above to report issues. The Steam Link for Meta Quest FAQ page is available here. Anyone can opt into the SteamVR Beta. Instructions are available here. SteamVR:Default environment is now the \\\"Aurora\\\" (can be disabled in settings)Added cont...\",\"date\":1790204709,\"title\":\"SteamVR Beta Updated - 2.18.1\"},{\"author\":\"aaron.leiby\",\"contents\":\"SteamVR has been updated with the following changes. SteamVR:Fixed per-app Motion Smoothing Force Always-On setting (was getting ignored).Linux:Fixed two separate issues affecting AMD gpus on Linux that were causing crashes.Steam Link:Default Contrast Adaptive Sharpening (CAS) to off. Enable in SteamVR Settings -> Steam Link -> Sharpen image before encoding.CAS now only applied to VR game content (not dashboard, overlays, desktop view, etc.).OpenXR:Changing frame_controller_valve interaction pro...\",\"date\":1789752514,\"title\":\"SteamVR Hotfix 2.17.10\"},{\"author\":\"aaron.leiby\",\"contents\":\"If you encounter issues with this update, please post in the SteamVR Bug Report forum. If possible, please include a system report to aid in tracking down your issue. Replies to this post are not tracked for bug reporting purposes. Please use the forum linked above to report issues. The Steam Link for Meta Quest FAQ page is available here. To get the most up-to-date features for Steam Link for Meta Quest, please opt-in to the Steam Link for Meta Quest Beta here as well as the SteamVR Beta.Anyone...\",\"date\":1789513902,\"title\":\"SteamVR Beta Updated - 2.17.10\"},{\"author\":\"J Bot\",\"contents\":\"Today's SteamVR release makes more Steam features available in VR, adds 32-bit OpenXR support, and improves the streaming experience.If you encounter issues with this update, please post in the SteamVR Bug Report forum. If possible, please include a SteamVR System Report to aid in tracking down your issue. The Steam Link for Meta Quest FAQ page is available here.Replies to this post are not tracked for bug reporting purposes. Please use the forum linked above to report issues. General:More in-ga...\",\"date\":1789077318,\"title\":\"Introducing SteamVR 2.17\"},{\"author\":\"aaron.leiby\",\"contents\":\"If you encounter issues with this update, please post in the SteamVR Bug Report forum. If possible, please include a system report to aid in tracking down your issue. Replies to this post are not tracked for bug reporting purposes. Please use the forum linked above to report issues. The Steam Link for Meta Quest FAQ page is available here. To get the most up-to-date features for Steam Link for Meta Quest, please opt-in to the Steam Link for Meta Quest Beta here as well as the SteamVR Beta.Anyone...\",\"date\":1788990801,\"title\":\"SteamVR Beta Updated - 2.17.9\"},{\"author\":\"charlesl\",\"contents\":\"If you encounter issues with this update, please post in the SteamVR Bug Report forum. If possible, please include a system report to aid in tracking down your issue. Replies to this post are not tracked for bug reporting purposes. Please use the forum linked above to report issues. The Steam Link for Meta Quest FAQ page is available here. To get the most up-to-date features for Steam Link for Meta Quest, please opt-in to the Steam Link for Meta Quest Beta here as well as the SteamVR Beta.Anyone...\",\"date\":1788293088,\"title\":\"SteamVR Beta Updated - 2.17.8\"}],\"players\":[{\"avatar\":\"https://avatars.steamstatic.com/ecbaf7ca5b46a1d1d067eac02e96c2dc44b76677_medium.jpg\",\"name\":\"JackDoesGaming\"}]}"}
{"timestamp":"00:09:40.188","source":"Browser","level":"LOG","message":"{\"game\":{\"appImage\":\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/374320/header.jpg?t=1748630784\",\"appid\":\"374320\",\"title\":\"DARK SOULS™ III\"},\"news\":[{\"author\":\"[BNE]plt\",\"contents\":\"Remain steadfast against the encroaching rain, Nightfarers. The Nightlord awaits your arrival. Make your landfall in Limveld on May 30th, 2025. https://store.steampowered.com/app/2622380/ELDEN_RING_NIGHTREIGN/\",\"date\":1739439727,\"title\":\"ELDEN RING NIGHTREIGN - Official Pre-Order Trailer\"},{\"author\":\"[BNE]plt\",\"contents\":\"In the Night, ancestral foes await - remnants of a fire that once burned bright. ELDEN RING NIGHTREIGN launches on PC Digital in 2025. https://store.steampowered.com/app/2622380/ELDEN_RING_NIGHTREIGN/\",\"date\":1734054432,\"title\":\"ELDEN RING NIGHTREIGN - Reveal Gameplay Trailer\"},{\"author\":\"[BNE] Beru\",\"contents\":\"A new update file for the PC version of \\\"DARK SOULS III\\\" has been released to fix some bugs. We apologize for the inconvenience, but please apply the latest update file before enjoying the game. Items included in the latest update Fixed some bugs in the recently released update file (1.15.1). The version number in the upper left corner of the title screen when this update file is applied is as follows. App Ver. 1.15.2 Regulation Ver. 1.35 Thank you for your cooperation.\",\"date\":1673518531,\"title\":\"Patch 1.15.2 Patch Notes\"},{\"author\":\"sjob\",\"contents\":\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/11088164/fc33d3364f231618d9107cf2eb7a8e5c60aa9225.jpg We are working to restore these features for all other Dark Souls titles and will inform you when they are back in service. Thank you once more for your patience and support. https://store.steampowered.com/app/374320/DARK_SOULS_III/\",\"date\":1661416949,\"title\":\"Online features for the PC version of Dark Souls III have been reactivated.\"},{\"author\":\"[BNE] Beru\",\"contents\":\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/32835102/6ec5a97acab49d37b302a901253499c9fa04c15e.jpg Click on the thumbnail for full sized picture: {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/32835102/5406f6505d8f8656e8bcffb0dde21e1689f9044a.jpg\",\"date\":1644483616,\"title\":\"Announcement\"},{\"author\":\"BNEAdmin\",\"contents\":\"Experience a first-look at narrated ELDEN RING gameplay giving players a deep-dive into the following areas of the game: Vast world design – the meticulously designed ”Lands Between” brings unprecedented immersion to FromSoftware’s largest game to date. Secrets hide around every corner of this immense world encouraging exploration for those who dare venture off the beaten path. Legacy Dungeons – Large multi-level dungeons evoking classic FromSoftware level design are integrated into the overworl...\",\"date\":1636048054,\"title\":\"Explore ELDEN RING with new narrated preview video and pre-order now.\"},{\"author\":\"BNEAdmin\",\"contents\":\"The next adventure from FromSoftware awaits. Wishlist now! https://store.steampowered.com/app/1245620/ELDEN_RING/ \",\"date\":1628201571,\"title\":\"ELDEN RING Coming Soon\"},{\"author\":\"shoupinou\",\"contents\":\"The team at BANDAI NAMCO wishes you happy holidays! http://cdn.edgecast.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/11088164/17a42e05d6450568d29f16a9619a0d1e93bc5597.jpg We can't wait to see you in 2018 to keep on playing on Dark Souls games together. Until then, will you find all the references - not only from Dark Souls series - hidden in our Season Greetings card?\",\"date\":1513791440,\"title\":\"BANDAI NAMCO wishes you happy holidays.\"},{\"author\":\"shoupinou\",\"contents\":\"The team at BANDAI NAMCO wishes you happy holidays! http://cdn.edgecast.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/11088164/17a42e05d6450568d29f16a9619a0d1e93bc5597.jpg We can't wait to see you in 2018 to keep on playing on Dark Souls games together. Until then, will you find all the references - not only from Dark Souls series - hidden in our Season Greetings card?\",\"date\":1513791440,\"title\":\"BANDAI NAMCO wishes you happy holidays.\"},{\"author\":\"shoupinou\",\"contents\":\"http://cdn.edgecast.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/11088164/2847a2f121599fb43714d3516fd0ee478dc36430.jpgAshen Ones, We are planning a server maintenance to update the regulations of Dark Souls III to version 1.35 tomorrow (read below for exact timings) Regulation version 1.35 includes the following adjustments: • Extended the matching range of players above level 351 for online play ad follow:http://cdn.edgecast.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/11088164/826b...\",\"date\":1497447167,\"title\":\"Dark Souls III regulation update 1.35\"}],\"players\":[{\"avatar\":\"https://avatars.steamstatic.com/38398b9d165c8d004d4f63fcb50ddf536409b92f_medium.jpg\",\"name\":\"JAX\"}]}"}
